Dialogue: 10,0:00:24.47,0:00:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,These aren't Seeno Evils!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:26.52,0:00:27.52,Default,,0,0,0,,They're Haters.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:27.52,0:00:30.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You've done too much to stand out in this world.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:32.40,0:00:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,This way!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:34.45,0:00:35.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What are Haters?!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:36.11,0:00:41.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Envy and spite created Haters \Nof you girls from among the Seeno Evils.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:41.58,0:00:45.41,Default,,0,0,0,,They don't have the guts to show \Ntheir faces, but they do have madness.{mad or angry?}
Dialogue: 10,0:00:45.41,0:00:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,They're strong in groups.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:47.08,0:00:49.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe as strong as a boss.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:49.04,0:00:50.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Run or hide.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:51.13,0:00:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,They're after you: the "heroes" in the limelight.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:55.55,0:00:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We're "heroes"?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:01.85,0:01:03.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Is your cut okay?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:06.23,0:01:06.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Great.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:07.98,0:01:09.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What's your name?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:10.56,0:01:12.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Yoshida Yae.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:12.15,0:01:13.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Yae, huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:14.15,0:01:16.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Hide here until the bell rings.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:17.15,0:01:20.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't clear the mission if you don't fight.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:20.99,0:01:23.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, focus on maintaining the status quo for today.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:24.54,0:01:26.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a solution in mind.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:26.33,0:01:28.70,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,But Yae is hurt.{TODO maybe it}
Dialogue: 10,0:01:28.70,0:01:29.29,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,It's my fault she—
Dialogue: 10,0:01:29.29,0:01:30.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Not a problem.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:30.92,0:01:34.21,Default,,0,0,0,,She'll regenerate in as little as ten minutes in her Egg.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:35.92,0:01:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, they found us?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:37.84,0:01:40.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Protect the Egg girl until time runs out.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:40.59,0:01:41.80,Default,,0,0,0,,That's your top priority.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:42.38,0:01:45.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Society is built on "report, contact, consult."
Dialogue: 10,0:01:45.09,0:01:46.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Say it out loud and share it!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:47.22,0:01:49.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Our greatest objective is...
Dialogue: 10,0:01:49.81,0:01:50.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Wonder...
Dialogue: 10,0:01:51.10,0:01:51.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Egg...
Dialogue: 10,0:01:53.06,0:01:54.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Priority.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:31.49,0:03:32.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Ai.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:32.83,0:03:35.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, it's time for breakfast.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:36.08,0:03:38.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Yesterday was rough.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:38.08,0:03:40.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on. Get up and help out.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:40.71,0:03:42.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:50.22,0:03:51.55,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,Ai?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:53.14,0:03:54.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Ai?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:54.02,0:03:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I know!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:01.07,0:04:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You want this, too?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:02.90,0:04:03.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:04.36,0:04:08.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I made you omelet rice for lunch. \NI know how much you like it.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:08.32,0:04:10.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You did? Yay.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:10.95,0:04:13.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, and I'll make us sukiyaki for dinner.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:15.54,0:04:16.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:16.37,0:04:19.87,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean? You love sukiyaki, don't you?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:20.25,0:04:22.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You only make it on special days.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:22.75,0:04:24.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Do I really?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:26.26,0:04:27.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess so.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:29.34,0:04:34.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Ai, would you have a proper talk with Mr. Sawaki today?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:34.97,0:04:38.68,Default,,0,0,0,,He's really concerned about you.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:38.68,0:04:42.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you think about the future, at least a little?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:44.94,0:04:46.40,Default,,0,0,0,,How about it?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:48.15,0:04:49.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll think about it.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:50.20,0:04:51.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Ai...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:51.91,0:04:53.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll think about it!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:53.74,0:04:54.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, okay.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:13.05,0:05:15.14,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,You went to school like that?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:15.14,0:05:17.72,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,Yup. Glistening lips and eyes like a panda.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:17.72,0:05:18.60,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,A panda?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:19.06,0:05:20.31,Default,,0,0,0,,She's here.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:20.31,0:05:21.44,Default,,0,0,0,,She is?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:21.44,0:05:22.38,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:24.61,0:05:25.89,Default,,0,0,0,,she's skipping.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:26.73,0:05:27.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What's up?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:27.86,0:05:29.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:29.32,0:05:30.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Now she's lashing out.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:30.74,0:05:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:35.07,0:05:36.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Why's she doing that?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:36.99,0:05:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know. Maybe something happened.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:40.29,0:05:42.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I've had a nightmare like this.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:44.71,0:05:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It ended horribly.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:48.38,0:05:50.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's just watch for a bit.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:54.18,0:05:57.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Congratulations. I see you managed to escape.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:57.56,0:06:00.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but what's with those Haters?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:00.31,0:06:05.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Who asked them to treat us like \Nheroes? We're not doing this for fun.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:05.23,0:06:08.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Regrettably, they can't be reasoned with.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:08.44,0:06:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Those who stand out pay for it, \Nin any time and in any world.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:12.57,0:06:15.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't you say you "had a solution in mind"?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:15.57,0:06:18.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes. Look, here it is now.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:18.70,0:06:20.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:21.79,0:06:25.42,Default,,0,0,0,,That case contains things that will support you.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:25.83,0:06:29.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Basically, it's what you call a "power up."
Dialogue: 10,0:06:30.01,0:06:31.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Like what?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:31.01,0:06:32.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Beats me.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:33.05,0:06:35.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I doubt we'll get to use it all the time.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:35.84,0:06:39.01,Default,,0,0,0,,If you've got something that handy, say so sooner!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:39.01,0:06:41.35,Default,,0,0,0,,These are extremely valuable.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:41.35,0:06:43.27,Default,,0,0,0,,We couldn't have you losing them.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:43.27,0:06:46.52,Default,,0,0,0,,That means, "Don't get used to it, idiots."
Dialogue: 10,0:06:56.41,0:06:57.53,Default,,0,0,0,,They're super cute!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:58.03,0:07:02.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You can have them free of charge. One each, of course.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:04.04,0:07:05.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Pendants?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:05.50,0:07:07.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Pomanders, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:07.17,0:07:08.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:09.17,0:07:11.30,Default,,0,0,0,,So, how do we use them?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:11.30,0:07:13.59,Default,,0,0,0,,First, you hatch them in this world.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:13.97,0:07:14.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Hatch them?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:15.38,0:07:17.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not so difficult.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:17.34,0:07:21.92,Default,,0,0,0,,They respond to body heat, so clasp \Nthem in both hands and gently rub them.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:22.43,0:07:24.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, but don't do it here.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:24.48,0:07:27.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Go home and open them when you're alone.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:27.61,0:07:28.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:29.11,0:07:31.11,Default,,0,0,0,,They require imprinting.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:31.11,0:07:34.61,Default,,0,0,0,,They see whoever meets their gaze first as their parent.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:34.61,0:07:37.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Chant "{\i1}veni{\i0}" to call them from their eggs.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:37.32,0:07:39.03,Default,,0,0,0,,"{\i1}Redi{\i0}" to return them.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:39.03,0:07:40.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Latin?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:40.53,0:07:43.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope my baby's a hottie.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:44.16,0:07:46.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what types do you think are in them?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:46.83,0:07:49.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We haven't imprinted yet, so we can trade, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:49.96,0:07:52.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Wanna swap with me, Neiru?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:52.13,0:07:52.96,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:54.59,0:07:56.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope you get the ugliest helper.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:02.93,0:08:04.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Ai...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:06.52,0:08:08.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Is something wrong?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:09.61,0:08:11.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You seem different.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:14.24,0:08:15.97,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a long story.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:24.66,0:08:25.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm leaving now, Ma'am.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:26.50,0:08:27.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:36.80,0:08:37.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Veni{\i0}.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:46.56,0:08:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,A snake.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:49.10,0:08:50.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:55.36,0:08:57.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure how to react.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:02.03,0:09:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Again?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:03.20,0:09:05.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry. We've got backup this time.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:06.45,0:09:07.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Veni{\i0}.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:15.84,0:09:17.05,Default,,0,0,0,,He ate it!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:17.05,0:09:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Haters are their favorite food.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:19.34,0:09:22.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Envy and spite are their bread and butter.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:24.35,0:09:26.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, I'm counting on you!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:31.23,0:09:33.35,Default,,0,0,0,,That should solve our Hater problem.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:34.23,0:09:35.27,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:40.24,0:09:42.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Yae, why did you kill yourself?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:45.04,0:09:45.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I can see.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:46.53,0:09:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,See what?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:48.33,0:09:51.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Dead people, strong grudges...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:52.16,0:09:54.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Like {\i1}The Sixth Sense{\i0}?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:54.29,0:09:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,See?! No one will believe me.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:57.34,0:10:01.01,Default,,0,0,0,,There are unbelievably scary things that only I can see.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:02.26,0:10:05.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry. I don't understand.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:06.22,0:10:07.39,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:07.39,0:10:09.81,Default,,0,0,0,,My friends left because it creeped them out.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:09.81,0:10:11.93,Default,,0,0,0,,My parents and teachers wouldn't believe me.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:11.93,0:10:15.56,Default,,0,0,0,,In fact, they thought I was crazy and put me in a hospital.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:17.11,0:10:19.98,Default,,0,0,0,,But what really scared me was what came next.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:20.49,0:10:21.24,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:21.61,0:10:26.53,Default,,0,0,0,,That hospital was overflowing \Nwith lots of people's resentment.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:26.53,0:10:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It was way worse than ghosts.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:28.58,0:10:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Those people's voices and their terrifying faces
Dialogue: 10,0:10:32.50,0:10:35.75,Default,,0,0,0,,poured into my head day in and day out!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:36.25,0:10:37.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Calm down!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:37.33,0:10:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, a boss is coming. I'll get ready for it.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:40.50,0:10:41.51,Default,,0,0,0,,It's already here!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:42.01,0:10:42.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:58.94,0:11:00.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Good evening, Ohto.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:03.11,0:11:06.36,Default,,0,0,0,,G-Good evening.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:06.83,0:11:09.95,Default,,0,0,0,,It's dinner time, so dry your hair quickly.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:09.95,0:11:11.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'll help you.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:11.74,0:11:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:14.21,0:11:16.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Please take a seat.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:17.12,0:11:18.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:18.21,0:11:19.63,Default,,0,0,0,,He's staying?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:25.35,0:11:26.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:26.05,0:11:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:29.89,0:11:31.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for dinner.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:32.60,0:11:34.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Ai, wait a moment.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:34.93,0:11:35.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Ai!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:36.52,0:11:38.97,Default,,0,0,0,,We have something to tell you.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:39.90,0:11:41.77,Default,,0,0,0,,If it's school, I need a little more—
Dialogue: 10,0:11:41.77,0:11:44.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not school. Just sit down.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:55.13,0:11:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen calmly, okay?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:00.00,0:12:03.88,Default,,0,0,0,,We've been thinking that we'd like to start dating.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:12.39,0:12:16.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, we're not going to do \Nanything if you're not okay with it.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:31.95,0:12:34.03,Default,,0,0,0,,My uncle and Ai's mom?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:34.45,0:12:38.71,Default,,0,0,0,,That means we might end up being family!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:39.29,0:12:41.24,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you excited about?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:41.71,0:12:43.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I mean...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:43.09,0:12:43.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, Ai?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:45.25,0:12:47.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Does she look happy to you?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:47.92,0:12:49.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you against it?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:50.84,0:12:54.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I told them to do whatever. It's none of my business.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:54.39,0:12:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you fought as hard as you could.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:56.98,0:13:01.19,Default,,0,0,0,,And that I wouldn't take care of them \Nor live with them in the future.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:01.19,0:13:04.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I said I'd put them in a home and only visit sometimes.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:04.78,0:13:06.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice. You really let 'em have it.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:07.48,0:13:10.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Why? Do you feel bad for your real dad?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:10.95,0:13:16.08,Default,,0,0,0,,No. They're already divorced, and \NDad might have someone new himself.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:16.08,0:13:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, there's no problem—
Dialogue: 10,0:13:17.70,0:13:19.33,Default,,0,0,0,,There is.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:20.54,0:13:23.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you listen to people, Momoe?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:23.21,0:13:28.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean that my uncle might have been \Ninvolved in Koito's suicide?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:28.26,0:13:29.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you, there's no way.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:29.72,0:13:31.51,Default,,0,0,0,,And what if there was?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:31.51,0:13:33.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Sawaki's younger than Ai's mom.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:33.64,0:13:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,He'd be her younger live-in boyfriend.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:36.22,0:13:37.47,Default,,0,0,0,,So?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:37.47,0:13:38.85,Default,,0,0,0,,"So"?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:39.48,0:13:43.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Live-in boyfriends are always abusing their girlfriends' kids.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:43.02,0:13:47.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Violently if it's a son, sexually if it’s a daughter.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:47.19,0:13:52.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but don't lump my uncle \Nin with the men your mom's dated.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:52.66,0:13:53.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What'd you say?!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:54.20,0:13:57.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean it's possible that Mr. \NSawaki likes young girls like us,
Dialogue: 10,0:13:57.79,0:14:01.37,Default,,0,0,0,,meaning that Ai's mom is a decoy and he's really after Ai?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:01.37,0:14:05.38,Default,,0,0,0,,No way. Besides, he knows that Ai's my friend.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:06.88,0:14:08.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think it's like that.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:10.34,0:14:14.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I just... don't like not knowing about Koito.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:15.39,0:14:19.88,Default,,0,0,0,,If they marry, you'll have to cover \Nfor him to protect your mom.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:20.60,0:14:23.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Unbelievable. I've heard enough.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:23.14,0:14:26.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Momo. That's not what I...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:26.06,0:14:28.65,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,What on Earth are they talking about?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:28.65,0:14:30.11,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,No clue.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:30.11,0:14:34.78,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,Not what clothes would go with \Nthose necklaces, that's for sure.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:34.78,0:14:39.33,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,Sometimes, family matters take \Nprecedence over life-or-death battles.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:40.91,0:14:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess we'll never know the truth \Nunless we bring Koito back and ask her.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:45.58,0:14:46.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Occam's razor.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:48.09,0:14:51.30,Default,,0,0,0,,There might be a factor complicating matters.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:51.30,0:14:52.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:52.13,0:14:55.09,Default,,0,0,0,,What? There's {\i1}more{\i0}?!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:56.39,0:14:57.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Ai likes Mr. Sawaki, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:59.76,0:15:01.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh! Yeah!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:01.72,0:15:03.77,Default,,0,0,0,,"The simplest theory is the best."
Dialogue: 10,0:15:03.77,0:15:05.19,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, Neiru?!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:05.19,0:15:07.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You're wrong! I don't...
Dialogue: 10,0:15:07.77,0:15:08.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Emotional!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:08.77,0:15:11.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Complicated and emotional!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:11.11,0:15:14.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't! That's totally impossible!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:20.62,0:15:21.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:23.50,0:15:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay away!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:24.92,0:15:27.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't ask to be able to see you.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:27.75,0:15:30.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not your friend or anything like that!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:37.59,0:15:38.80,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:52.99,0:15:54.05,Default,,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 10,0:15:55.07,0:15:56.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:57.53,0:15:58.45,Default,,0,0,0,,It's here?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:59.24,0:16:01.06,Default,,0,0,0,,But I can't...
Dialogue: 10,0:16:01.62,0:16:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, don't kill that girl!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:08.00,0:16:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Prayer beads?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:11.92,0:16:16.38,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,You mean that my uncle might have been \Ninvolved in Koito's suicide?{TODO brain?}
Dialogue: 10,0:16:20.56,0:16:23.89,Default,,0,0,0,,We've been thinking that we'd like to start dating.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:32.61,0:16:35.72,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,There might be a factor complicating matters.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:37.07,0:16:39.95,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no reason to have a complex.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:39.95,0:16:42.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Your eyes are charming.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:45.16,0:16:46.95,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,Ai likes Mr. Sawaki, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:50.42,0:16:51.36,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:55.42,0:16:56.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:57.42,0:16:59.87,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:04.93,0:17:06.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:06.77,0:17:07.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me—
Dialogue: 10,0:17:10.52,0:17:13.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm telling you, I don't!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:28.12,0:17:31.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I'm really mad!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:42.47,0:17:45.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You can see me, Miss?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:46.10,0:17:49.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. But I can't be your friend.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:55.02,0:17:56.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I bet it was tough,
Dialogue: 10,0:17:57.07,0:18:00.03,Default,,0,0,0,,dealing with these monsters all on your own.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:00.99,0:18:02.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You believe me?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:03.36,0:18:04.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:15.71,0:18:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Your name is Leon.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:18.00,0:18:19.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Not very creative.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:20.67,0:18:21.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Veni{\i0}.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:25.89,0:18:26.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Redi{\i0}.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:31.73,0:18:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Veni{\i0}.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:37.65,0:18:40.86,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,Ai, Mr. Sawaki is leaving.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:40.86,0:18:42.01,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,Don't mind me.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:42.65,0:18:44.98,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,See you next week, Ohto.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:02.34,0:19:04.01,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,I'm home.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:04.01,0:19:05.33,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,In the bath, Ai?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:05.80,0:19:06.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome back.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:07.39,0:19:09.64,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,Oh, don't leave your dirty clothes here.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:09.64,0:19:11.39,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,What do I always tell you?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:11.39,0:19:14.85,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,Turn the pockets inside-out for washing.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:16.31,0:19:19.40,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,I'll leave what was in your pockets here.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:25.24,0:19:25.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:25.90,0:19:27.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Ai?!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:27.61,0:19:28.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll catch a—
Dialogue: 10,0:19:28.37,0:19:29.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm fine!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:31.16,0:19:33.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you going dressed like that?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:33.75,0:19:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,,School!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:34.66,0:19:35.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:12.24,0:20:14.29,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,Bye-bye, Mr. S.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:14.58,0:20:15.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:18.50,0:20:19.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Sawaki.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:33.56,0:20:34.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Ohto?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:36.81,0:20:38.31,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:44.72,0:20:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Ohto.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:47.40,0:20:49.81,Default,,0,0,0,,The sky is clear and beautiful.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:50.57,0:20:52.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It was a passing shower.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:54.91,0:20:55.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 10,0:21:02.71,0:21:03.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm...
Dialogue: 10,0:21:08.09,0:21:09.66,Default,,0,0,0,,going to go to school!
Dialogue: 10,0:22:47.31,0:22:48.61,Default,,0,0,0,,To be continued.
